<title>JAPAN: RESEARCH ALERT - U-shin rated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - U-shin rated.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daiwa Institute of Research</p>
<p>Ltd has assigned U-shin Ltd a &quot;B&quot; rating, Daiwa Securities</p>
<p>brokers said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>In its three-grade rating system, the research institute assigns</p>
<p>a &quot;B&quot; rating to issues whose values it sees moving within 10</p>
<p>percentage points in either direction of the Tokyo Stock Exchange</p>
<p>first-section TOPIX index over the next six months.</p>
</text>
